            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. For the purpose of computing pay for hours worked on a Paid Holiday, employees working a graveyard shift which continues into such Holiday shall receive premium pay as prescribed in the Holiday article of this Agreement. Those graveyard shift employees beginning their workday starting the night of the Holiday, however, shall not be paid such Holiday premium pay.",
